OL,3,AJudge dismisses Trump's lawsuit against
OL,4,AWall Street Journal over Epstein
OL,5,Abirthday book
OL,6,
OL,7,FA US judge has thrown out President
OL,8,FDonald Trump's $10bn (#7.4bn) lawsuit
OL,9,Fagainst The Wall Street Journal, ruling
OL,10,Fthe suit was "grasping at straws".
OL,12,FTrump had sued the media outlet's
OL,13,Fparent company Dow Jones and its leader
OL,14,FRupert Murdoch last year after it
OL,15,Freported on a letter allegedly written
OL,16,Fby Trump to disgraced financier and sex
OL,17,Foffender Jeffrey Epstein as part of a
OL,18,Fbirthday book in 2003, before Epstein
OL,19,Fwas charged with sex crimes.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11914
SC,0014
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1793528753
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJudge dismisses Trump's lawsuit against
OL,4,AWall Street Journal over Epstein
OL,5,Abirthday book
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump has denied writing or signing the
OL,8,Fletter, which included suggestive
OL,9,Flanguage and a drawing of the outline
OL,10,Fof a woman's body.
OL,12,FJudge Darrin Gayles threw out the case,
OL,13,Ffinding the suit runs counter to the
OL,14,FFirst Amendment, which protects freedom
OL,15,Fof the press.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
